  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Bosnia and Herzegovina. The main outcome areas it contributes to are democracy and human rights, equality and workers&apos; rights, and promoting peace and dialogue. The main rights holders are unemployed persons especially youth and women, and Busovaca citizens in general. Through study circles and capacity building the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
